LRV-i8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT2D8wNOUFhHsCHnCmBRAJ6ihV23N302xZ0zv5_ub9Tkw&oe=6B0DD04D"}, "display_name": "Emoji Clash VR", "keywords": ["Emoji", "Billiard", "Pool", "Bowling", "Action"], "long_description": "# \ud83e\udd23 Be the Emoji\n\nEmoji Clash VR is a thrilling VR action game where you become a colorful Emoji Ball battling across islands in the sky.\n\n# \ud83c\udfaf Physics-Fueled Showdowns\n\nLine up your shots and slam rival Emoji Balls off the edge. Every move counts. Bank shots, precision angles, and smart pushes are your weapons in this VR-powered duel of wits.\n\n{715619941358634}\n\n# \ud83c\udf0c Dynamic Sky Arenas\n\nBattle across islands with shifting platforms, tricky obstacles, and death-defying drops. Learn the terrain. Master the traps.\n\n# \ud83d\ude08 Fight Dangerous Enemies\n\nFace off against Bomb Enemies that explode with massive force, or Needle Enemies that punish you for careless contact. Expect chaos and surprises at every stage.\n\n{1920877891786040}\n\n# \u26a1 Unleash Epic Power-Ups\n\nGrab game-changing power-ups like lightning attacks and energy beams before your enemies can.\n\n# \ud83d\ude80 Level Up and Dominate\n\nGain experience by knocking enemies into the stage\u2019s black hole to increase your attack power and speed for future battles.\n\n{2191517354658721}", "short_description": "Emoji Clash VR is a thrilling VR action game where you become a colorful Emoji Ball battling across islands in the sky."}]}, "developer_name": "Odd Team XR Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://odd-team-xr.com/emoji-clash-vr/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Odd Team XR Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://odd-team-xr.com/emoji-clash-vr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": 